{"title":"Basilisk","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 31 Basilisk that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/basilisk\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/basilisk?lv=31\">Lv 31 <span>14</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/basilisk?lv=32\">Lv 32 <span>11</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/basilisk?lv=31\" title=\"Pick level 31\"><td><b>31</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>124</td><td>21.6</td><td>1,550</td><td class=\"muted\">372 · 30.2 · 4,650</td><td>14</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Dune%20Raider%20Stronghold\">Dune Raider Stronghold</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/basilisk?lv=32\" title=\"Pick level 32\"><td><b>32</b></td><td>131</td><td>22.1</td><td>1,600</td><td class=\"muted\">393 · 30.9 · 4,800</td><td>11</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Dune%20Raider%20Stronghold\">Dune Raider Stronghold</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 38 total, 38 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-large\" title=\"Health Potion Large - in 100% of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/752437a6ecea30afa5ec.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 1/1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Dune%20Raider%20Stronghold\">Dune Raider Stronghold</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 17 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"basilisk\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Basilisk: <a href=\"#/monster/sand-basilisk\">Sand Basilisk</a> <span class=\"muted\">(26)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/elder-basilisk\">Elder Basilisk</a> <span class=\"muted\">(36)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/fc3809d4eadf8416dacc.webp\" alt=\"Basilisk\"></div><h3>Basilisk</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>31 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 31–32)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Basilisk</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>124</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>21.6</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1550</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>24 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}